  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $f(x)=\\left[\\frac{1}{|x|}\\right]$ Domain $=R-\\{f(x)=0\\}$\r\nNow, $f(x)$ will be zero, when $|x|=0$. $\\Rightarrow \\quad x \\in[0,1)$\r\n$\\therefore$ Domain of $f(x)=R-(0,1]$ and range of $f(x)=\\{-1,0,1\\}$",
